# PiEconetBridge configuration for the published Beebium recipe (#143).
# Rendered by run-recipe.sh; @NAME@ placeholders are substituted.
#
# No WIRE NET line: every network here is a Null network, carrying local
# emulation and distant AUN hosts only, so no Pi, HAT or kernel module is
# needed. Every net number must be non-zero.
#
# The fileserver: station 1.254, with its filestore at @FILESTORE@.
FILESERVER ON 1.254 PATH @FILESTORE@
# Beebium as station 2.80, at @BEEBIUM_HOST@ port @BEEBIUM_AUN_PORT@. NONE
# leaves acknowledgement to Beebium itself rather than the bridge (AUTOACK).
AUN MAP HOST 2.80 ON @BEEBIUM_HOST@ PORT @BEEBIUM_AUN_PORT@ NONE
# EXPOSE lines must come last: upstream's config parser requires it.
EXPOSE HOST 1.254 ON PORT *:@BRIDGE_AUN_PORT@
